                "text": "I secured federal support for Leech Lake Band\u2019s new women\u2019s inpatient treatment wing (aptly named Zoongi-ide Ikwewaag, or \u201cStrong-hearted women\u201d) to make sure women had access to culturally appropriate treatment near their homes and families. https://t.co/CT91XGr4RN",
